{
  "name": "Multi-ATS Career Jobs Hiring Signals (Greenhouse, Lever & Ashby) -> Google Sheets & Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-ats-daily",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/yannabadie~multi-ats-jobs-api-mcp/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{$env.APIFY_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"mode\": \"search\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"engineer\", \"data\", \"ai\"],\n  \"postedWithinDays\": 7,\n  \"includeDescription\": false,\n  \"maxResults\": 50\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "apify-ats-call",
      "name": "Fetch Multi-ATS Career Jobs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "valid-job-id",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.jobId}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-valid-jobs",
      "name": "Keep Valid Job Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "hiring-signal-label",
              "name": "signalLabel",
              "value": "={{$json.companySlug}} [{{$json.ats}}] — {{$json.title}} ({{$json.location || 'Unspecified'}})",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "id": "set-hiring-signal",
      "name": "Format B2B Hiring Signal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        920,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ATS_Hiring_Signals",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "recordKey": "={{$json.recordKey}}",
            "jobId": "={{$json.jobId}}",
            "ats": "={{$json.ats}}",
            "companySlug": "={{$json.companySlug}}",
            "title": "={{$json.title}}",
            "department": "={{$json.department}}",
            "location": "={{$json.location}}",
            "isRemote": "={{$json.isRemote}}",
            "salaryText": "={{$json.salaryText}}",
            "postedAt": "={{$json.postedAt}}",
            "jobUrl": "={{$json.jobUrl}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "recordKey"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "sheets-ats-upsert",
      "name": "Upsert Jobs into Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1180,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL}}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": \"B2B Hiring Signal: *{{$json.signalLabel}}*\\nSalary: {{$json.salaryText || 'Not listed'}} | Remote: {{$json.isRemote ? 'Yes' : 'No'}}\\nApply: {{$json.jobUrl}}\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "slack-ats-alert",
      "name": "Post Hiring Signal to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Multi-ATS B2B Hiring Signals (7 ATS Engines)\n1. Set n8n env vars `APIFY_TOKEN` (free Apify account includes $5/mo credits) and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n2. Optionally pass target `careerUrls` or `boards` (`greenhouse`, `lever`, `ashby`, `smartrecruiters`, `workable`, `recruitee`, `workday`) in **Fetch Multi-ATS Career Jobs**.\n3. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and click **Test Workflow**.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-ats-setup",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Idempotent Hiring Feed\n- **Keep Valid Job Records** drops summary rows.\n- **Format B2B Hiring Signal** builds a clean Slack headline (`signalLabel`).\n- **Upsert Jobs into Google Sheets** matches on `recordKey` to avoid duplicates across daily runs.",
        "height": 175,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-ats-output",
      "name": "Deduplication & Signal Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Multi-ATS Career Jobs",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Multi-ATS Career Jobs": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep Valid Job Records",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep Valid Job Records": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format B2B Hiring Signal",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format B2B Hiring Signal": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert Jobs into Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Post Hiring Signal to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "instanceId": "yannabadie-multi-ats-jobs-template-v1"
  }
}
